[["To summarize, the key findings of our research, stated in one sentence that includes all relevant information, are that", [".............................................................................................. 2 CHAPTER 2..................................................................................................................11 To summarize, the main findings of the literature review, stated in one or two sentences that include all relevant information, were that:......................................................... 12 CHAPTER 3..................................................................................................................13 To summarize, the findings of the data collection and analysis, stated in one paragraph that includes all relevant and important information, were that........................................................ 15 CHAPTER 4..................................................................................................................16 To summarize, the recommendations of the research,", "....................................................................................... 2 The key findings of the research, in more detail, are:........................................................... 2 The main research question was:......................................................................................... 3 The key research question was:............................................................................................ 3 The main research objectives were:....................................................................................... 3 The key objectives of the research were:............................................................................... 3 CHAPTER 2..................................................................................................................", "........................................................................................ 1 CHAPTER 2..................................................................................................................12 To summarize, the main findings of our research on the performance monitoring system of Management Sciences for Health (MSH), South Africa, are that:.................................................. 12 CHAPTER 3............................................................................................................... 14 To summarize, the recommendations of our research are that:................................................................................................................................................. 14 CHAPTER 4................................................................................................................ 16 To summarize, the limitations of our research are:........................................................................................................................... 16 CHAPTER 5"]], ["In summary, our research is concerned with", ["the development of a model for performance monitoring for organizational learning.", "the development of a performance monitoring system for organizational learning in the context of the South African HIV/AIDS sector, and the use of this system to support organizational learning and performance improvement.", "how to improve performance monitoring for organizational learning."]], ["In summary, a comprehensive and detailed conclusive statement would be that", ["MSH has not fully embraced the concept of performance monitoring as an organizational learning tool.", "this research has provided an in depth understanding of performance monitoring for organizational learning in a non-profit organization......................................................................................................... 1 CHAPTER 2..................................................................................................................10 Introduction................................................................................................................ 10 The research question............................................................................................... 11 CHAPTER 3..................................................................................................................12 Literature Review..................................................................................................... 12 Theoretical framework............................................................................................. 14 Performance monitoring for organizational learning: A conceptual model................ 16 CHAPTER 4..................................................................................................................18 Methodology.............................................................................................................. 18 Research design", "MSH is an organization with a very strong culture and a clear vision."]], ["A comprehensive summary for our work would be that", ["the Performance Monitoring System for Organizational Learning (PMSOL) was implemented at the South Africa office of Management Sciences for Health (MSH).", "the MSH SA performance monitoring and reporting system has been developed to provide the management and the Board of Directors with the information they require to make decisions.", "we have developed a system to help MSH South Africa (MSH SA) monitor the performance of their projects and programs in South Africa."]], ["The main takeaway from our work is that", ["performance monitoring is a key component of an organization\u2019s learning process.", "performance monitoring is not just a matter of collecting data.", "the performance management system at MSH South Africa is a good system, and that the performance management process is working well."]]]